### Root Cause Analysis

The error log indicates a timeout when attempting to click on a UI element with the text "Branch: develop". This suggests that the element is not found within the specified timeout period. The root cause could be that the element is not present on the page, or the selector used to locate the element is incorrect or not specific enough.

